<title>PHILIPPINES: Philippine govt securities secondary market rates.</title>
<headline>Philippine govt securities secondary market rates.</headline>
<dateline>MANILA 1997-01-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following are secondary market rates quoted by banks on Friday for Philippine government securities. The rates are indicative as maturities are slightly varying.</p>
<p>			     ---------------</p>
<p>  BANK		     RATES BID/OFFER PCT</p>
<p>			    3-mths	   6-mths	  1-year</p>
<p>Bank of America	10.75 /10.65   11.10 /10.90   11.60 /11.40</p>
<p>BPI			10.80 /10.675  11.125/11.00   11.55 /11.40</p>
<p>Citibank		 10.70 /10.625  11.125/10.90   11.50 /11.375</p>
<p>HongKong Bank	  10.75 /10.65   11.075/10.95   11.45 /11.375</p>
<p>Metrobank		10.75 /10.60   11.00 /10.90   11.55 /11.375</p>
<p>Multinational	  10.80 /10.65   11.15 /11.00   11.45 /11.35</p>
<p>PCIBank		  10.75 /10.675  11.20 /11.05   11.625/11.415</p>
<p>Security Bank	  10.85 /10.65   11.25 /11.05   11.50 /11.35</p>
<p>SolidBank		10.70 /10.665  11.075/11.025  11.50 /11.40</p>
<p>Standard Chartered   10.75 /10.65   11.10 /11.00   11.45 /11.35</p>
